---
import Section04History from "@web/components/Section04History.astro";
import Section03Stats from "@web/components/Section03Stats.astro";
---
<div id="view-history" hidden>
  <main class="wrap arch-wrap">
    <section class="folder-sec subpage-hero-sec" style="margin-top:0">
      <div class="folder-tab-row">
        <div class="folder-tab">
          <span class="sec-no">HISTORY</span>
          <span class="t-ja">活動のあゆみ・記念日・統計</span>
          <span class="t-cn">活动年表 · 纪念日 · 发行记录</span>
          <span class="t-en">History, Special Dates &amp; Chronology</span>
        </div>
        <span class="folder-en">2017–2026 · TIMELINE ARCHIVE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="folder-body subpage-intro-body">
        <p class="sec-lede" style="margin-bottom:0">
          <span class="t-ja">2017年から現在までの活動の流れ、大切な記念日や今日の記録、年別・月別の作品公開推移をまとめて振り返ることができます。</span>
          <span class="t-cn">集中收录 2017 年至今的四个创作阶段、特别纪念日与今日记录，以及各年度月份的作品发行脉络。</span>
          <span class="t-en">A dedicated view gathering her 2017–2026 timeline, special dates &amp; daily almanac, and chronological release pacing.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Section04History />
    <Section03Stats />
  </main>
</div>
